@startuml
actor 居民
actor 商户
actor 管理员
participant "Redemption API" as API
database "数据库" as DB
participant "Outbox Handler" as Event
居民 -> API : POST /api/redemptions {product_id}
API -> DB : UPDATE users SET balance=balance-cost WHERE balance>=cost
API -> DB : UPDATE products SET stock=stock-1 WHERE stock>=1
alt 余额或库存不足
 API -> DB : rollback
 API --> 居民 : 409(无扣分、无扣库存)
else 校验通过
 API -> DB : 创建兑换单+负向流水+Outbox事件，commit
 API -> Event : 派发 RedemptionCreated
 Event -> DB : 创建Settlement(PENDING);订单TO_FULFILL
 API --> 居民 : 兑换成功
 商户 -> API : 订单核销
 API -> DB : Redemption.status=FULFILLED
 管理员 -> API : 积分清算
 API -> DB : 检查已履约;Settlement=SETTLED
end
@enduml
